Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.98,0:01:39.41,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Okay, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:42.83,sign_2384_3_Special_Officer_,Onscreen,0,0,0,,Special Officers' School \NTactical Practice Grounds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.72,0:01:41.36,Italics Top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Now further back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:42.84,Italics Top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Push them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.09,0:01:44.23,Italics,All,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:49.54,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Do we go around?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.89,0:01:52.97,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Just wait, you pieces of scrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.97,0:01:56.69,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blow a giant hole \Nin your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:03.88,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Hey, Marcel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:05.34,Main,Student,0,0,0,,We're going to crash into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.86,Main,Student,0,0,0,,We're saved...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:29.55,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.00,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Sorry, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:32.20,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:33.61,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.61,0:02:36.73,Italics,Instructor,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:39.30,Italics,Instructor,0,0,0,,Get out of there, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:48.27,Main Top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Cadet Marcel, what the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:49.27,Dates,,0,0,0,,{\fad(487,477)}February 11th, Stellar Year 2149
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:50.63,Main Top,Marcel,0,0,0,,I wanted to get behind the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:52.97,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,And so you went over the hill?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:56.05,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Exposing your Feldreß's belly \Nto enemy fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:59.45,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Your grade for this exercise is zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.67,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Go back to basic!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:02.50,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:04.37,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Next, Cadet Nouzen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:07.87,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Jumping in a Vánagandr? \NAre you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:09.57,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Are you trying to destroy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.57,0:03:12.86,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I judged that it was the only way \Nto avoid a collision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:19.56,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It's better to lose the legs on one \Nthan losing both altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:20.62,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Shin...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:22.19,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:26.40,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,I'll give you credit \Nfor avoiding a collision.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:29.53,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,But you still engaged in dangerous piloting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.14,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,So you get a zero, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:32.40,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:33.06,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:38.61,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Nouzen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:43.39,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:44.93,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I don't need you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:47.41,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,For one thing, you didn't need to dodge. \NI could've—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:49.12,Main Top,Shin,0,0,0,,I said you don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:53.37,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Let's go, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:55.59,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:04:00.42,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,It's nice being young, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:02.60,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Is that how it looks to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:04.85,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,You're so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:07.58,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,What is it today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:09.38,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,I want you to come with me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:10.87,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,I got permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:16.59,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Eugene, you need to put some distance \Nbetween you and Nouzen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:17.67,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:23.87,Main,Classmate,0,0,0,,You know about the new Feldreß those\N Eighty-Six are working on with R & D.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:25.23,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Those things are insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:30.44,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,They're based on the Republic's designs, \Nwhich don't factor in pilot safety at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:35.84,Main,Student,0,0,0,,They say a dozen of its test pilots \Nhave already died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:38.81,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,But none of them got hurt at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:40.33,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,That's just a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:42.09,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.41,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,But he gives me a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:47.80,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Almost as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.19,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,As if what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:54.32,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,He's the Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:04.26,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Are you guys ready for a trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:08.07,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,April 1st, Stellar Year 2149
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:11.98,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,How far are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:12.91,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Is this a training exercise?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:13.82,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:16.54,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,But something's on those trucks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:18.82,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Oh, with the tarp over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:27.62,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,When you came through this place, \Nit was still under Legion control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:31.35,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,But we've taken this place back \Nover the last six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:42.08,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,We moved up the battle lines \Nand found these stranded Republic Feldreß.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:45.56,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,There was a plate among them \Nwith names on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:48.58,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,In the Federacy, \Nwhen someone dies in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:51.95,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,their name is engraved on a memorial \Nin the National Cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.95,0:05:54.65,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,We decided the names \Nof your comrades on the plate,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:58.70,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,all 575 of them, \Nshould be recorded here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.26,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,So we did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:03.60,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Don't worry. \NAfter we recorded the names on the plate,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:06.24,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,we returned it to its original spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:08.23,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:11.67,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Thank you for your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:17.57,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,But you've graduated the \NSpecial Officers' School,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:21.86,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,so now you're part \Nof the Giad Federacy's military.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:26.03,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,And before long, \Nyou'll be sent into battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:37.80,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,You'll be working in the Nordlicht squadron, \Nwhich is under my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:43.76,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,I am Lt. Colonel Grethe Wenzel, \Ncommander of the 1028th Test Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:45.69,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Glad to be working with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:47.82,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:53.15,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Hey, you didn't need to throw us off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:54.39,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Frederica?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.77,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:59.92,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Don't look! \NThis is a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:00.96,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,A surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:01.89,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:07.13,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.13,0:07:08.14,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,A scavenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.14,0:07:09.39,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,That's Republic tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.39,0:07:10.08,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:10.86,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Fido?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.63,0:07:13.32,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:16.75,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Do you name all your pets \Nthe same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:19.23,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,No, this is Fido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:21.76,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,The one who was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:29.38,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,We investigated when we found it \Nand discovered its core unit was intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:31.38,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Grethe rebuilt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:36.26,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,We've replaced the mechanical parts, \Nbut this is the real Fido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:40.30,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,It looks the same, \Nbut it's several times stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:41.82,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:46.97,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,He also thought he was dead \Nand refused to activate at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:52.20,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,He only turned on \Nwhen I gave him Shinei's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.29,0:07:58.32,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,You are the proof that we made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.91,0:08:01.58,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Perform your mission until you rust away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:07.51,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:12.46,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I ordered to do your mission \Nuntil you rusted away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:19.74,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,But well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.24,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Want to go home together, once more?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:30.48,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Saw that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:32.78,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be a little worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:33.52,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:35.62,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,It'd take more than that to break Fido.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.07,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I meant Shinei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:37.92,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:39.20,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Oh, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:42.01,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Shin knows how Fido moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:42.90,Main,Frederica + Grethe,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:48.14,Main,Grethe,0,0,0,,So he does know how to smile, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:56.90,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,So, Frederica, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:09:00.09,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Because I'm your mascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:01.45,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,"Mascot"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:02.75,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:08.28,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,They have young girls like me \Njoin a unit and eat and sleep with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:10.91,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,The unit becomes a found family
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:15.65,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,and becomes willing to risk their lives \Nfor their beloved daughter or sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:17.24,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It's a Giad tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.23,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,That's sickening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.23,0:09:20.98,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Do you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:21.54,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:25.86,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'll be joining the 1028th Test Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:30.26,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Which means I'm your goddess of victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.62,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.40,0:09:36.16,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,By the way, Shinei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:38.72,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I have another surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:42.56,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I got it from Ernst.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:45.94,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It's important to you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:50.76,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.48,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:09:59.89,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:00.70,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:01.67,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:05.43,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Glad to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:09.96,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,July 28th, Stellar Year 2149
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:14.96,sign_14649_154_Giad_Federacy_We,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(484,472)}Giad Federacy Western Front Lines
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.84,Italics Top,Soldier 1,0,0,0,,Enemy squadron incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:15.64,Italics Top,Soldier 1,0,0,0,,Forty-five seconds to contact!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:17.86,Italics,Soldier 2,0,0,0,,I'm not dying yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:24.13,Main,Soldier 3,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:26.15,Main,Soldier 3,0,0,0,,Where's our suppression fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:29.76,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:32.08,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you \Ntake me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:40.71,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,How many of these damn things are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:42.98,Italics,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Stand fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.23,0:10:45.62,Italics,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Even if you run, they'll catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:48.64,Italics,Soldiers,0,0,0,,I'm honored to die \Nfor my homeland and my comrades!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:53.75,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:30.06,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,That's the new Reginleif...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:35.09,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Eighty-Six...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:39.22,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,Monsters of the Republic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:53.59,Main,Tech,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, you used \Nthe high-frequency blade again, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:54.32,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:57.52,Main,Tech,0,0,0,,Stop abusing that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:12:00.61,Main,Tech,0,0,0,,We don't have a spare blade yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:03.64,Main,Tech,0,0,0,,And even besides that, \Nthe way you use it—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:04.31,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:06.91,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,The Legion are going to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:07.73,Main,Tech,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:14.55,Main,Tech,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:24.90,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Well done, Shinei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:27.74,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You snuck in here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:31.72,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You can't get rid of me \Nby begging the repair crew to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.14,0:12:34.82,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I told you not to follow us \Nonto the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:37.42,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You're just a mascot. \NRemember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:40.35,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You don't get to tell me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:45.65,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,A commanding officer isn't supposed \Nto go running alone into enemy territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:47.19,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It's a bad habit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:49.61,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Bernholdt was complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.31,0:12:53.32,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Are you listening, Shinei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:55.91,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You need to take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.56,0:12:59.58,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I can't get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.58,0:13:01.96,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Help me, Bernholdt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:02.88,Main,Bernholdt,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:06.19,Main,Bernholdt,0,0,0,,But you should quiet down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:09.47,Main,Bernholdt,0,0,0,,Everybody's tired after days of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:11.78,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:16.77,Main,Officer 1,0,0,0,,Hey, what are Nordlicht doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:20.98,sign_19131_198_Giad_Federacy_Fo,Onscreen,0,0,0,,Giad Federacy Forward Operation Base 15 (FOB15)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:20.99,Main Top,Officer 2,0,0,0,,We sent a request \Nfor help yesterday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:24.23,Main,Officer 1,0,0,0,,A 2nd Lieutenant running a whole battalion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:26.89,Main,Officer 2,0,0,0,,Supposedly all his superior officers died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:29.32,Main,Officer 2,0,0,0,,Right now, it's at a squadron's staffing level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.57,0:13:31.52,Main,Officer 1,0,0,0,,Who killed them, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:34.01,Main,Officer 3,0,0,0,,The headless skeleton, \Npossessed by a Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.01,0:13:35.26,Main,Officer 3,0,0,0,,Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:39.69,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Stop it, Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:41.80,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Sorry, you eat with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:48.51,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Can I sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.87,0:13:50.05,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:53.41,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Eugene? You ended up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:55.18,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I got here last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:57.20,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:57.88,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:08.42,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,If you can't eat them, \Ndon't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:12.10,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,But that would be rude to the kitchen staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:28.22,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Then try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:34.10,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,You saved us yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:36.71,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:39.57,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,There were so many requests \Nfor help, I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:41.30,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,You're busy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:44.39,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Busy enough for the squadron \Nto be split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.39,0:14:46.82,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,That's why it's just the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:49.64,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Hey, I remember you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:51.88,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,You remembered me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.16,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:56.29,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I heard you ended up \Nin Shinei's class at school!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.20,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It must've been hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:15:01.96,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Yeah. He's really cold, \Nand he never talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:04.66,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,You never know what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:07.19,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I know! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:11.04,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You talk to him, and he doesn't even look up \Nfrom his book, or say a word!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:14.61,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,If it's not something he's interested in, \Nhe won't even listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.61,0:15:18.41,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,And he does really crazy stuff at weird times!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:20.65,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,That's right! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:22.18,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I think we'll get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:24.13,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Let's be friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.02,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:26.39,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:27.90,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:31.53,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,How about we take a photo \Nto remember this day!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:32.55,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:34.84,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Shinei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:43.41,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Is this part of the job \Nfor a goddess of victory?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:46.10,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It's all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:49.34,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:54.81,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I don't want to interrupt a meeting \Nbetween old friends, so I'll be going!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:16:00.83,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,She became a mascot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:02.05,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:04.37,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Nobody even likes that old custom anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.79,0:16:08.17,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Even someone like her, \Nif she's there, we have to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:13.32,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,We're all strangers, \Nso they must think they need a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:15.32,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:17.76,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,She choose that path.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.96,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,But she doesn't have a reason to fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:23.97,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Family, country, justice, making a living...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:26.46,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,None of that matters to a kid that age!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:29.96,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,So why does she have to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:32.84,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.35,0:16:38.98,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,How's your sister? Is she doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:41.47,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.98,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,She's kind of lonely, \N'cause she's staying with my aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.31,0:16:46.11,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Aunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:49.33,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Oh, we don't have parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:52.55,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I want her to go to a good school,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.03,0:16:54.68,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,so I need to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.75,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It's rough being a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:57.98,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Great, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:16:59.35,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,You can't have her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:01.61,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I've already got a little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.69,0:17:05.74,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I'm taking her somewhere \Non my next leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:08.99,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,A zoo or an amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:15.39,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Maybe shopping. Since she's a little girl, \NI bet she'd love clothes or shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:19.01,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Then you really shouldn't have \Njoined the military, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:21.91,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,The war's not going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:24.51,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,And I don't think that's going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:28.51,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Yes. My unit lost fifteen \Npeople just yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:32.82,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Our commander said this is normal \Nwhen things get bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:34.99,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,"Normal," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:38.27,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I don't think that many dead is "normal."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:42.49,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,The number of dead and the number \Nof destroyed Legion don't match at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.49,0:17:44.77,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,It sure doesn't feel like we're winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:49.63,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,From the generals' perspective, \Nit probably just means fewer mouths to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:51.85,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:54.52,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:58.04,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,But then what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.55,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Why did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.34,0:18:08.30,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Again? They never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:11.33,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I bet girls don't like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:16.08,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Okay, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:22.63,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,You're safe, right, Shinei?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:23.54,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:24.65,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:26.26,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:28.49,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.49,0:18:30.10,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,I have bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:43.46,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Frederica, close your "eyes."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:58.61,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Nina...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:13.49,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,The picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:16.77,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Nina's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:40.61,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:53.04,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.69,0:20:27.77,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Eugene...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:33.26,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Did you do that, Nouzen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:34.45,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:36.30,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Make the casualty report.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:41.12,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,Why didn't you save him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:42.79,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,You could've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:46.71,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,You were too busy fighting \Nthose hunks of steel, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.55,0:20:50.27,Main,Marcel,0,0,0,,You battle-mad Eighty-Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:52.32,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,Stop it, Lieutenant Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:56.28,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,Are you no different \Nfrom those scum in the Republic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:20:58.67,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:03.18,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,And thank you for what\N you did for Lieutenant Rantz.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:04.08,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:05.78,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,So let me say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.11,0:21:11.96,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,If you joined up out of a desire \Nto repay us for saving you, there's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:17.64,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,We will never force poor children \Nlike you to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:19.66,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:22.13,Main,Officer,0,0,0,,Leave the army and live happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.13,0:21:23.52,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,The Legion are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:25.44,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Meet up with your allies while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.37,0:21:34.89,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Shinei?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.89,0:21:36.03,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,What's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:38.32,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:41.79,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Nordlicht has new orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.14,0:21:46.25,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Gather up at point 27-32 \Nin preparation for a new attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.25,0:21:48.58,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,Then stand by for further orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.79,0:21:49.68,Italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:53.70,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Shinei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.23,0:21:58.05,Italics,Frederica,0,0,0,,You're okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:03.41,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.65,0:23:38.04,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,"Welcome back."
